 "274145057562076", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982625_274145064228742_3473110845850649786_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VOh8-PQ-Dh4Q7kNvwFWS373&_nc_oc=AdnMnuaRJYajbNQbgqkVICp2_JTH3gjzUnnwF2We7tXO9l3MFZNPLy8PWMZU8jgDH_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuhuyQNh_liCPYydKsWPHvMIXiQiGV9L96vXcoDtWVC8g&oe=699EE096"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Talespin App (App Lab)", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The Talespin App is your home for immersive learning content. Access the full library of available content in one central location, including Talespin\u2019s off-the-shelf learning content, and your organization\u2019s custom titles. With the Talespin App, users experience engaging lessons and scenarios, accelerated learning, and built-in performance scoring to track skills development. \n\nKey features include the Talespin App lobby displaying your organization\u2019s learning content titles, integration with the Talespin Platform to manage users and content permissions, and in-app scoring and reporting to the Talespin Platform\u2019s skills data dashboard. The future of work starts here.", "short_description": "The Talespin App is your home for immersive learning content. Access the full library of available content in one central location, including Talespin\u2019s off-the-shelf learning content, and your organization\u2019s custom titles. With the Talespin App, users experience engaging lessons and scenarios, accelerated learning, and built-in performance scoring to track skills development. The future of work starts here."}]}, "developer_name": "Talespin Reality Labs, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.talespin.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Talespin Reality Labs, Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://support.talespin.com/", "website_url": "https://www.talespin.com/", "category": "A